%% CI pipeline overview (README-style snippet)
flowchart LR
    dev[Developer] -->|git push| gh[GitHub]
    gh --> ci{CI Checks}
    ci -->|pass| build[Build Image]
    ci -->|fail| notify[Notify Author]
    build --> registry[(Container Registry)]
    registry --> deploy([Deploy to Staging])
    deploy -.-> smoke{{Smoke Tests}}
    smoke ==> prod[Production]
